      "side": 1,
      "message": "1. I\u0027m not following this. I would expect the TCPM to always send a valid SOP type, but if it sends an invalid one, wouldn\u0027t it make sense to log an error for that?\n2. Assuming it makes sense to check for a valid SOP type here, shouldn\u0027t you use `\u003c\u003d`?",
